# Review routing. A path listed here requests the owner's review automatically.
#
# The point is not ceremony: these are the paths where a mistake is expensive or
# hard to reverse — a migration that has already run, an auth boundary, a
# compliance record, or the module that is deliberately separable from the rest
# of the product. Everything else follows the repository default.
#
# Syntax: last matching pattern wins, so the specific entries sit below the
# catch-all.

*                                               @ShawnDaPrawn

# Database changes reach production without a staging run — see docs/STATUS.md.
/supabase/migrations/                           @ShawnDaPrawn
/supabase/cron/                                 @ShawnDaPrawn
/supabase/config.toml                           @ShawnDaPrawn

